<title>SINGAPORE: Osprey Maritime 1996 net profit up 3 pct.</title>
<headline>Osprey Maritime 1996 net profit up 3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in millions of US$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			  16.01    vs   15.51</p>
<p>Dividend (cents)		   2.75    vs    1.83 (adjusted)</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		 11.10    vs   10.75 (adjusted)</p>
<p>    Turnover			    85.75    vs   59.12</p>
<p>    Operating profit		  31.63    vs   24.88</p>
<p>    Interest income		    1.81    vs    1.71</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		17.88    vs   10.79</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		    17.23    vs   15.80</p>
<p>Dividend pay date: to be announced</p>
<p>Note - Osprey Maritime is a ship charter company.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
